  "_comment": "Shared vectors for bearer-token extraction from an Authorization header value: Go BearerToken, Java ProtectedResource.bearerToken, Python bearer_token, TypeScript bearerToken. Every port must return `token` for `header`: the extracted token, or null where there is none (Go returns \"\"). Semantics: SEMANTICS.md, Bearer extraction.",
